<title>USA: EquiMed chairman adds CEO post.</title>
<headline>EquiMed chairman adds CEO post.</headline>
<dateline>TUCKER, Ga. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>EquiMed Inc said Monday it had named its chairman, Douglas Colkitt, to the additional post of chief executive.</p>
<p>The company's former chief executive, Larry Pearson, continues as president and takes on the additional role of chief development officer, it said.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
